// Test: IN clause with notice type ranges
// Verifies range expansion: 5-11 -> (5,9,10,11), E1-E2 -> (E1,E2)
// Range 5-11 crosses alphabetical boundary and spans gaps (6,7,8 don't exist)

---- STAGE 1a ----

WITH ND-SubNode
    ASSERT BT-00-Text is present
    AS ERROR R-K7P-M2Q
    FOR BT-00-Text IN 5-11, E1-E2
